    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea4faaeeeef12dea1cfed73",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……训练员，您也经常读书对吧？\r\n我记得之前在您桌上看见过一本相当厚的书呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ecd16b2a5f05259727114ac8c666fa3381bf71319c02da221b919d52947de1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
