      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02f86da76f45ef8e7f5af527",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我听着罗布罗伊的话，回忆了一下那天我桌上摆的东西。\r\n好像是有本包了书壳的厚书来着。是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "068aff43ec4d915c0a0726a2d005edaf04b6f452a71516758731a42836ce08d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
