      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而我身边的荒漠英雄——则俯视着被染作橙黄色的街道，\r\n一边因脑中复杂的想法而烦恼着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11ada2d77b4dfaefba983f6897171a56baf9b1e16147aa225495892fcad26dcb",
